{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_title", "source_sha256": "62c7a1eaec79613f17ac54f21831961e1b605fe0072a52eab22330f546662a6f", "ja": "ある晴れた日の歌声", "zh": "某个晴天的歌声", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_synopsis", "source_sha256": "36aa4a31a9b2c4bec22cb206923c0eb0e30a9c5195eaa253b7372dece4c4bd80", "ja": "センターを務めることになった歌織。\nこれまでの合唱の舞台とは違うステージに\n戸惑う彼女だったが、莉緒や亜利沙たちと\nの交流の中で、アイドルになることの意味\nに触れ、仲間と共に公演を成功させる。", "zh": "歌织即将担任Center。\n面对不同于过去合唱团表演的演出，\n她感到有些迷惘。但在和莉绪及亚利沙的\n互动中，歌织渐渐了解何谓偶像，\n并和伙伴们一起顺利完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "f0515c1cb4e87256e77735ddb2c982d18242447c8a99ec1f3cc10b39575c3d47", "ja": "歌織ちゃんって、お肌\nキレイよね……。普段、\nどんな化粧品を使ってるの？", "zh": "小歌，你的皮肤好好喔……\n你平常都用什么保养品？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "9ce8fd10ce6eb57d9cd281f95c488a9eba000a5155f088beed46cdbbffef4837", "ja": "スタイルもいいし、\nきっと昔から\nモテモテだったんでしょ～？", "zh": "而且身材也很好，\n肯定从以前就很有异性缘吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "c178aeaa5b005734f747a975a74425f4b3e6e7baf27f64bd2a57f0d165750005", "ja": "そんな、モテモテだなんて……。\n全然そんなことなかったわよ？", "zh": "怎么会，异性缘什么的……\n完全没有这种事喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "76da278ee8d49c9ed8700ade1c9af2324b412846c09c758b9489aa130d7d7281", "ja": "ウソ！？　こんなにキレイな人を\n放っておくなんて。男の子の\n気持ちがわからないわ……。", "zh": "骗人！？这么漂亮的女生，\n竟然会没有人追。\n真搞不懂男生在想什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "b14ec904ce0abee0f0031f537db4c92b136ff26387b3880a810d6b1b908e6a4b", "ja": "ふふ、ありがとう、莉緒ちゃん。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你，莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "976cf72186f2f8147592c9070a566c913fb7da73f09a56af2017bcd4001c009e", "ja": "でも、外見で選んでもらうより\n内面で選んでもらえる方が、\n私はうれしいかな。", "zh": "不过，与其靠外表受人青睐，\n我会比较希望对方\n被我的内在所吸引呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "ceac9c3ad33f6dd651eb02750d0ca6483fc6dc310b780bfd0bd8f5e64e611fe2", "ja": "お付き合いするっていうことは、\n長い時間を一緒に過ごすって\nいうことだから……。", "zh": "毕竟两个人交往，\n就代表要相处很长一段时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_005_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "ac8a0454c6210d80f94ceb28a19b87e1dc1c099669f6fe6254f334769d0b572e", "ja": "そ、そうよね！　……あれ？\n私って外見ばっかりに\n気を遣い過ぎ……？", "zh": "说、说得也是！\n……哎呀，难道我太在意外表了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
